---
// KaTeX stylesheet, self-hosted from node_modules (NOT a CDN). Math is rendered
// to HTML+CSS at build by rehype-katex; this CSS + its bundled fonts (Vite
// rewrites the url()s and emits the woff2s to /_astro) are all the browser needs
// — zero JS.
//
// Imported with `?url` (a hashed asset-URL *string*), NOT as a side-effect
// `import '…css'`, for the same reason as CjkFonts: a side-effect import is
// collected by Astro's per-page CSS crawl and would ship the ~24KB stylesheet on
// every page sharing Layout's module graph (blog index, about, …), even ones
// with no math. `?url` ships it only where this <link> renders: posts whose body
// contains `$…$`.
import katexHref from 'katex/dist/katex.min.css?url';
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href={katexHref} />
